{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c0d5b75b2edf9fbfd85062afecc8b75101c68f0a7572298e8c7549edaf8512b1", "ja": "（これから美奈子のソロライブのリハーサルだ。\n美奈子はステージにあがり、熱心に声を出している）", "zh": "（接下来是美奈子的个人演唱会彩排。\n美奈子登上舞台，正热情地练习发声。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "1518bf05f330db671a4d65faf7c9936b38369f4e3bac29abd7e4e13273e5e24b", "ja": "みんなで一緒に歌ってね！　せーの、はい！\nき・み・と！　ぜっ・た・い！　……うん、よしっ。", "zh": "大家要一起唱哦！预备，开始！\n和・你・一・起！绝・对・要！……嗯，好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "eb77937bffbe271b21b4bcebfec59d3c87fcc80a9c48d2bfe92973ee9e26bc6b", "ja": "美奈子、おつかれさま。\nちょっと休憩しないか？", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦了。\n要不要稍微休息一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "71b2bdf742d8c8af65e711b2b0fee6e4713b7edf84e247159e7a4cb5dc339b2d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\nふう、つい熱が入っちゃいました……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n呼，一不小心就练得太投入了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2169fd9dbc74075bd30d214b27f5fec6fab82050ae468458f93396a194d57d4c", "ja": "でも声は出てるし、調子は良さそうだな。\nもしかしたら緊張してるかな、と思ったけど。", "zh": "不过声音很有力，状态看起来不错。\n我还以为你可能有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "4c613a3e290a9ba75edb37803023645cd105f789c4b59b2ba9f29f076cc0a57d", "ja": "緊張はしてますよ？　ステージにひとりっきりだと、\nまだちょっと心細いっていうか……えへへ。", "zh": "我确实有点紧张哦？一个人在舞台上的话，\n还是会觉得有些不安……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "745db9db0ab5b1bd98af28d33aea75349c0ee71eb72a9a320966d6aa762aa8ba", "ja": "でも私、このライブの最初のメニューは\n私の笑顔！って決めてるんです。", "zh": "不过，我已经决定了，这场演出的第一道菜就是我的笑容！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "590304c3db0ce58da2e7a23d575c0b12b2c18c1e9ea6767570711bd29b0a64dd", "ja": "せっかく来てくれたお客さんですし！　楽しい気持ちで\n心もおなかも、いっぱいになってもらわなくちゃ！", "zh": "难得客人都来了！一定要让大家怀着愉快的心情，心里和肚子里都填得满满的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f502ca8bd04ec5e768bee677dd09570ce29c3c88ef70dd86b158f699b30b234b", "ja": "ああ、おなかはともかく、\n心は満腹になってもらえると思うぞ！", "zh": "啊，肚子先不说，我觉得至少能让大家的心填得饱饱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "9dcff8a86037cad3844a5152f5a50f785c0ac80fd19c241ae8c16fe143deeab3", "ja": "あ……そっか。やっぱり、おなかは無理ですよね。\nむしろ、ライブのあとはおなかがすくかも……。", "zh": "啊……这样啊。果然，肚子还是没法填饱的呢。说不定，演唱会结束后反而会饿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cb4a8bf753cdcb414cee4017062a42de9d889e6f5957cc179d2db5f83ce37fa6", "ja": "……そうだな。でも、お客さんにとっても、\nその方が嬉しいんじゃないか？", "zh": "……也是啊。不过，对观众来说，\n那样反而更令人高兴不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "e7d818ef291b66c3366c833805e494e286115381b8dc0bc9b7bd42b89330191d", "ja": "えっ？　嬉しいんですか？　おなかがすくのに……？", "zh": "咦？这样会开心吗？明明会肚子饿……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "29f578199a1b5a25bc475fe70a1d8dc07462104cbdba044f9483a7fac48541b3", "ja": "だって、心が満腹だから。幸せな気持ちのままご飯を\n食べて、また満腹になれたら、二度嬉しいだろ？", "zh": "因为心里已经很满足了。怀着幸福的心情吃饭，肚子也能再次填饱的话，不就是双倍的开心了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "0fa0d4c027b6175ce6b5f2284aa5afa0dc600f9044da23beb058947e040d27c5", "ja": "わぁ……、そうですね！　それに楽しい気持ちで食べる\nご飯は、きっと美味しいから、ご飯もすすむかも！", "zh": "哇……确实是这样呢！而且怀着开心的心情吃饭，\n肯定会很美味，说不定还能多吃几碗饭呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "d8bbb6b22dd4a12054728fc81d117f594187d41bb05fd0330f5be9df052d7104", "ja": "わっほ～い！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇～呼！\n非常感谢您，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "7845862a654d16a13d48029fee9b17d2cfab21b53a441e1ced0b8de102cebc5a", "ja": "お客さんに最高に美味しいご飯を食べてもらうためにも\n私、最高の笑顔で、最高のライブにしてみせますね！", "zh": "为了让客人吃到最美味的饭菜，我也会用最棒的笑容，努力把这场演出办成最棒的演唱会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c726629828f36a32871d22aee593f2f400dae1eaa3e217913d75cf2ab7532430", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ。美奈子の笑顔で心を満腹にして、\n幸せになってもらおう！", "zh": "啊，就是这股劲头。用美奈子的笑容填饱大家的心，让他们幸福吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "b1dc7ab37e24cce525df34bfb5ff129b053d8c06533b4ecdb4c9e7d5f31668f3", "ja": "はーい♪　あ、{$P$}さんも、\nちゃんと見ててくださいね？", "zh": "好呀♪啊，{$P$}先生也要好好看着哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0164_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "81df26c6e7609c8994d2e03f69af3de463f4152cbb9d2a3bf56529127fc9e669", "ja": "私の笑顔で、いちばん満腹になってもらいたい\n人は……。えへへっ♪", "zh": "我最想用自己的笑容，让哪个人吃得最饱呢……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
